@startuml
' Source (synthetic brief): The Saturday signing was announced on local radio on
' Thursday. Saturday walk-in traffic was three times normal. The till syncs stock
' counts to the web shop overnight only, so the web shop kept selling the signed
' edition after the shelf ran out: 40 copies oversold, refunded on Monday.
' Not stated: whether the distributor could have restocked in time.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
skinparam wrapWidth 300
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam legendBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam legendBorderColor $LEGEND_FRAME
hide stereotype
hide circle
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
rectangle { RoundCorner 14 }
.failure { BackgroundColor #FADBD8 }
.group1 { BackgroundColor #E3F2FD }
.group2 { BackgroundColor #E8F5E9 }
.group3 { BackgroundColor #FFF3E0 }
.group4 { BackgroundColor #F3E5F5 }
</style>
' Numbered steps (optional, STYLE rule 16): $step(1) prints a blue badge in a label, an edge label
' or a legend table row. Knob STEP_BADGE: the badge colour.
!$STEP_BADGE = "#1565C0"
!function $step($n)
!return "<back:" + $STEP_BADGE + "><color:#FFFFFF><b> " + $n + " </b></color></back>"
!endfunction
' house-preamble-end

title Why the signed edition oversold (causal chain)

rectangle "Radio announces the signing" as radio
rectangle "Walk-in traffic 3x normal" as traffic
rectangle "Shelf stock runs out" as shelf
hexagon "Web stock in sync?" as sync
rectangle "Web shop sells on stale count" as stale <<failure>>
rectangle "40 copies oversold" as oversold <<failure>>
file "Refund log (Monday)" as refunds
cloud "Distributor restock" as distributor

note right of sync
  Till pushes stock counts to the
  web shop overnight only
end note
note right of distributor
  Could it restock in time?
end note

radio --> traffic : Thursday
traffic --> shelf : Saturday
shelf --> sync
sync --> stale : no, overnight sync
stale --> oversold
oversold --> refunds
distributor ...> shelf : not stated

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | rounded box | event |
  | hexagon | check |
  | cloud | external service |
  | note shape | document |
  |<#FADBD8>| failure |
  | dashed line | not stated in the source |
endlegend
@enduml
